From 3caa2c047d98ff6ae69e6e3b22b0b40f6f01c748 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nishant Sharma <nishant.sharma@arm.com>
Date: Thu, 4 Apr 2024 23:28:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] neoverse-rd: add sds banks for the remote chips

In an multichip environment, each SCP write the pcie configuration
information in is local Secure SRAM memory. BL2 can initialise all the
banks, read the data and concatenate it.

Add the support to initialize and read the data from all the SDS banks
and program it to the non secure bootloader fdt.

Signed-off-by: Nishant Sharma <nishant.sharma@arm.com>
Change-Id: Ibacccfbee09e96920b4d99ad21468f2562d63864

Signed-off-by: Jon Mason <jon.mason@arm.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
